---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="行前准备 - 中国入门指南" lang="zh">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12">
    <header class="mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 leading-tight mb-4">
        行前准备
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-500">
        落地中国前必完成的步骤 — 签证、证件、App 和落地72小时规划。
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-6 not-prose">
      <!-- 签证指南 -->
      <a href="/zh/prepare/visa/" class="block p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 hover:border-brand-200 hover:shadow-sm transition-all group">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center">1</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 m-0 group-hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors">签证与入境规则</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-600 ml-11">
          查看是否符合免签、240小时过境条件，或需要办理旅游签证。
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium ml-11 mt-2">阅读指南 →</p>
      </a>

      <!-- 入境证件清单 -->
      <div class="block p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 opacity-60">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-gray-200 text-gray-400 text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center">2</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 m-0">入境证件清单</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-600 ml-11">
          护照、签证、入境卡、酒店预订和返程机票 — 你需要出示的材料。
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 ml-11 mt-2">即将上线</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 落地72小时规划 -->
      <div class="block p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 opacity-60">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-gray-200 text-gray-400 text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center">3</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 m-0">落地72小时规划</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-600 ml-11">
          落地后立即要做的事：买 SIM 卡、开通微信支付、办地铁卡、解决上网问题。
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 ml-11 mt-2">即将上线</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 安全与应急 -->
      <div class="block p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 opacity-60">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-gray-200 text-gray-400 text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center">4</span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 m-0">安全与应急准备</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-600 ml-11">
          警察、救护车和大使馆电话，出发前保存好。中国很安全，但有备无患。
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 ml-11 mt-2">即将上线</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
